# working design plans — kept local. This repo is public, and the plans discuss
# unreleased work and the internals of the Jembatan API (auth, CORS and rate-limit
# gaps) in a detail that shouldn't be published. Signed-off *outputs* still belong
# in design-reference/ and DESIGN.md.
/design-reference/plans/
